  "name": "CHELSAch-highres-climatologies (Switzerland) (V1.0)",
  "description": "CHELSAch-highres-climatologies is a high-resolution climate dataset generated with the CHELSA downscaling model for Switzerland. It consists of long-term 30-year mean aggregated surface variables.",
